              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भले ही — bhale hī — \"even though; even if\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भले ही (bhale hī) रास्ता लंबा है, फिर भी हम चलकर जाएँगे। Bhale hī rāstā lambā hai, phir bhī ham calkar jāeṅge. Even though the way is long, we will go on foot."
            }
          ]
        },
