          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भले ही (bhale hī) is bhale, a form of bhalā, \"good\", which CDIAL derives from Sanskrit bhalla, \"auspicious\" (CDIAL 9408), with the emphatic hī: \"well and good, even so\"."
            }
          ]
        },
